      "content": "That's a pretty strong stance. I was looking more for a breakdown of their logical structure. \n\nCould you go back and try to steelman their point first? Like, if someone actually believes that national identity is the best way to prevent social fragmentation, what would be the strongest version of that argument? I want to see if the student's reasoning is actually sound before I tell them where it fails.",
